        Let $F$ be a filtration of $\cat C_m$, and let $\F$ be a feature of $\cat C_m$. For every $u\leq v$, the \emph{$\F$-steady} and \emph{$\F$-ranging sets} of $F$ are defined as follows:
        \begin{align*}
        S^\F_F(u\leq v) &= \Bigl\{ (A,F_u)\ /\ \forall w\in[u,v],\ F_u^w(A,F_u)\in\F \Bigr\} \\
        R^\F_F(u\leq v) &= \left\{ (A,F_u)\ /\ \exists x\leq u,\ y\geq v\ \tx{and}\ A'\ /
        \begin{cases}
          (A',F_x)\in\F &\tx{with}\ A=\Phi F_x^u(A')\\
          F_u^{y}(A,F_{u})\in\F
        \end{cases}  \right\}
        \end{align*}
