            The exclusivity feature is defined as follows:
            $$ \F^x = \left\{ (A,H), \tx{with}\ H=(V,E)\ \tx{such that}\ A=\{e\}\subseteq E \ \tx{and}\ e\ \tx{has an exclusivity} \right\}$$

            \begin{proposition}\label{prop_convex-exclusivity}
                $\F^x$ is convex in $\cat{Hgph}^=_m$.
            \end{proposition}
