\subsection{Related Works}
In this section, we introduce the state of the art clustered into four technical tracks: (i) ISAC for IIoT, (ii) near‑field ISAC and near-field and far‑field coexistence, (iii) Enhanced ISAC with NOMA and RIS and (iv) cooperative bandwidth splitting ISAC. For clarity, the related papers are classified in the Table \ref{related works} according to the specific keywords.



\subsubsection{ISAC for IIoT}
