\begin{remark} Lin \cite{Lin1, Lin2} displayed for the first time examples of non-reflexive spaces having the FPP for nonexpansive maps. In fact, he showed that $\ell_1$ admits an equivalent norm which enjoys the FPP. We do not know for which non-trivial moduli $\omega$ his renorming also has the FPP for $1$-$\omega$-nonexpansive maps. 
\end{remark}

