The \textit{set of empirically measured chart changes} is the collection of all such vectors $\left(\frac{\lfloor\Delta_{t_i} x^1\rfloor_{\hat{\delta}^1}}{\hat{\delta}^1}, \frac{\lfloor\Delta_{t_i} x^2\rfloor_{\hat{\delta}^2}}{\hat{\delta}^1}, 1,\frac{t_{i+1}-t_i}{\Delta}, \Delta_{t_i}w\right)$, $t_i \in t(\It)$  over all time windows $\It\in I$. For clarity, we define this set to be:

