each $X= (X^1_i, X^2_i)_{i \geq 0} \in \mathcal{X}$, 
set $\tilde{X} = (\tilde{X}_i)_{i \geq 0} \equiv (X^1_i)_{i \geq 0}$, $N(\tilde{X}) \equiv N(X)$  and define $f(\tilde{X})= F(X)= X^2_{N(X)}$ we then have 
