for the definition of the model variable $W_i$). Such a scenario never occurs historically, by definition of $w^*$, hence for any $w>w^*$  we set $N^*(x,I,w)=N_*(x,I,w)=0=T^*(x,I,w)=T_*(x,I,w).$\\

