%and for $t=t_c$, there are at least
%two ergodic equilibrium measures, $\delta_{\bar{1}}$, $\delta_{\bar{2}}$. \textcolor{lightgray}{If $t_c>-2$, these
%are the only equilibrium measures, but if $t_c<-2$, there is 
