As  $\gamma_{1}$ and $\gamma_{0}$ are conditional
expectation functions, and $\tau(x)=\gamma_1(x)-\gamma_0(x)$, we follow \citet[][Proposition 4]{newey1994asymptotic}
to pin down the form of the efficient influence function. Slightly violating notations,  write
