= & -\mathbb{E}\left[2\left(\gamma_{1}(X)-\gamma_{0}(X)\right)\left(\mathbf{1}\left\{ \gamma_{1}(X)-\gamma_{0}(X)\geq0\right\} -\delta(W)\right)^{2}\left(\tilde{\gamma}_{0}(X)-\gamma_{0}(X)\right)\right]\\
