where $\varsigma_{1}(d,x):=2\left(\gamma_{1}(x)-\gamma_{0}(x)\right)\left(\mathbf{1}\left\{ \gamma_{1}(x)-\gamma_{0}(x)\geq0\right\} -\delta(w)\right)^{2}\frac{d}{\pi(x)}$.
Moreover, let $\mathbb{E}_{t}[\cdotp]$ be the expectation under $P_{t}$,
a one-dimensional subfamily of $P\in\mathcal{P}$ that equals the
